    &gt;Documentation&lt;/a&gt; - The manual you should read&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://jan.ai/api-reference&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;API Reference&lt;/a&gt; - For the technically inclined&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://jan.ai/changelog&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Changelog&lt;/a&gt; - What we broke and fixed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://discord.gg/FTk2MvZwJH&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Discord&lt;/a&gt; - Where the community lives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
